Do not assume ChatGPT and Codex automatically
share conversation history.

## 12. Current Development Priority

Current focus:
Debugging human obstacle avoidance after
Vision and Planning integration.

Known problems:
1. Path planning frequently fails when human obstacles are active.
2. Human capsule radius may be excessively large.
3. Human capsule radius fluctuates between frames.
4. Collision geometry may be overly conservative.
5. Vision-to-Planning coordinate consistency requires verification.

Priority:
Verify and improve the existing integration
before introducing new planning algorithms.